{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262o2t8dBBgB1793118933.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>空手道總會舉行慶功宴，亞運銀牌得主、個人形世界排名第一的劉慕裳，認為這次旅程很有得著。</p><p></p><p>亞運空手道銀牌得主劉慕裳表示：「我經常都認為，輸的時候，學到的東西很多，但去到世界第一，都會學懂如何保持這位置，壓力最多是自己給自己，要學懂如何將焦點放在表現上自我進步，比獎牌及排名更重要。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.KARATE.CELEBRATE 2200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Sx3qd9Dw541793119331.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>劉慕裳過去兩屆亞運均奪得銅牌，今屆在個人形項目摘銀，是她的最佳成績。曾綺婷亦在女子組手奪銀，她說已完成在兒子面前比賽的目標，有獎牌是額外獎勵。</p><p></p><p>洪晧崴與鄧宇軒及李智剛，在男子團體形摘銅，空手道隊今屆奪2銀3銅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T17:20:29.293171+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:15.093890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:18.461978+00:00","content_hash":"158a13030a702f1882099da1aa8248503be3d2ef65c0b7366bda830d7c9eac2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T17:20:29.293171+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}